(4644654, 669367, 6519, '<td valign="top">Fabulous .... apart from that wonderful spirit/soul/apparition with it''s gorgeous colour, I love that you desaturated the face.<br/>If I HAD to pick on something, I''d say the mouth is a little TOO open.<br/> <br/>Can''t wait to find out exactly how you did this in basic editing.<br/> <br/>Perfect for this challenge. My pick of the bunch. 10.</td>', 'Fabulous .... apart from that wonderful spirit/soul/apparition with it''s gorgeous colour, I love that you desaturated the face.If I HAD to pick on something, I''d say the mouth is a little TOO open. Can''t wait to find out exactly how you did this in basic editing. Perfect for this challenge. My pick of the bunch. 10.', '2008-04-16 21:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4644656, 669922, 6519, '<td valign="top">Good job all around. The desaturation feels appropriate here, your blood looks believable and you didn''t feel the need to have gallons of it.<br/> <br/>Simple, clean shot full of impact and right on challenge-target. 9</td>', 'Good job all around. The desaturation feels appropriate here, your blood looks believable and you didn''t feel the need to have gallons of it. Simple, clean shot full of impact and right on challenge-target. 9', '2008-04-16 21:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4644658, 668372, 6519, '<td valign="top">You did a great job giving it that 1964 feeling. It looks very believable as a snapshot from that era. 8</td>', 'You did a great job giving it that 1964 feeling. It looks very believable as a snapshot from that era. 8', '2008-04-16 21:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4644661, 669566, 83080, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful classic feel.  The poses give a sense of aimless wandering, the gowns feel dated (in a good way), and the exposure is perfectly haunting.  This is one of my top picks.</td>', 'What a beautiful classic feel.  The poses give a sense of aimless wandering, the gowns feel dated (in a good way), and the exposure is perfectly haunting.  This is one of my top picks.', '2008-04-16 21:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4644664, 669989, 6519, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t have thought that I''d go for a pet-shot for this challenge, but you really made this one work very well.<br/>Your light''s a little harsh, but I love the idea and the angle/perspective. 8</td>', 'I wouldn''t have thought that I''d go for a pet-shot for this challenge, but you really made this one work very well.Your light''s a little harsh, but I love the idea and the angle/perspective. 8', '2008-04-16 21:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4644667, 669402, 6519, '<td valign="top">I''m rarely a fan of high-key shots, but in this case it works. <br/>I don''t like her being so centered because the space to the right doesn''t add anything useful to the shot, but the suggestion of the figures on the other side is great! 8</td>', 'I''m rarely a fan of high-key shots, but in this case it works. I don''t like her being so centered because the space to the right doesn''t add anything useful to the shot, but the suggestion of the figures on the other side is great! 8', '2008-04-16 21:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4644672, 668109, 6519, '<td valign="top">I like it, it is sufficiently weird enough to look other-worldly.<br/>Very simple, and possibly lacking an actual subject, but it still works for me.</td>', 'I like it, it is sufficiently weird enough to look other-worldly.Very simple, and possibly lacking an actual subject, but it still works for me.', '2008-04-16 21:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
