(4644684, 668899, 6519, '<td valign="top">Hidden face or not, those balls (complete with the colours, glow, and shadows) look weird enough to pass as paranormal.<br/>I like it, but I think it would be even better if you had done something else with them, something more than just having them sit there.</td>', 'Hidden face or not, those balls (complete with the colours, glow, and shadows) look weird enough to pass as paranormal.I like it, but I think it would be even better if you had done something else with them, something more than just having them sit there.', '2008-04-16 21:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4644690, 669367, 83080, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  We''re sure to see this on the front page (not that I have any paranormal predictive powers).  Love the lighting &amp; composition and this illusion is particularly impressive for basic editing.  I have a couple of guesses, but I do hope you''ll share with us how you achieved this.</td>', 'Fantastic!  We''re sure to see this on the front page (not that I have any paranormal predictive powers).  Love the lighting & composition and this illusion is particularly impressive for basic editing.  I have a couple of guesses, but I do hope you''ll share with us how you achieved this.', '2008-04-16 21:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4644691, 669350, 83080, '<td valign="top">Awesome entry!!  This is so impactful, unnatural, creepy and well executed (double entendre intended) that I predict no one will score it fairly for fear of having to see it on the front page for the next week.</td>', 'Awesome entry!!  This is so impactful, unnatural, creepy and well executed (double entendre intended) that I predict no one will score it fairly for fear of having to see it on the front page for the next week.', '2008-04-16 21:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4644692, 669652, 83080, '<td valign="top">Nice job concealing the suspension.  Particularly impressive given the basic editing limitations!  You must have been very patient getting this set up just right.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Nice job concealing the suspension.  Particularly impressive given the basic editing limitations!  You must have been very patient getting this set up just right.  Congratulations.', '2008-04-16 21:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
