(4644710, 670054, 83080, '<td valign="top">Nice creepy effect.  I wonder if your ghost might had a little more impact in amongst the more dense and tall stones I see in the background.  The stones in the foreground seem slightly less ominous and interesting.  Still, I like this overall particularly because you had the good taste to do the hooded character thing.</td>', 'Nice creepy effect.  I wonder if your ghost might had a little more impact in amongst the more dense and tall stones I see in the background.  The stones in the foreground seem slightly less ominous and interesting.  Still, I like this overall particularly because you had the good taste to do the hooded character thing.', '2008-04-16 21:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4644712, 668757, 91402, '<td valign="top">this pic creeped me out...8</td>', 'this pic creeped me out...8', '2008-04-16 21:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
