(4644745, 670058, 83080, '<td valign="top">The textures are great, the smoke is just right, and the lighting works well.  The only thing that didn''t strike me right on my first impression is that the feet seem too close to the door.  It feels to me like the toes must be almost under it which takes away from the feeling (that I imagine you intended) that this ominous door is about to be opened.  Still, the overall effect works well and it''s very otherworldly indeed.<br/> <br/>---After looking at it for a while, it strikes me that my initial bias was to see the door as pulling open rather than pushing open.  Strange psychology on my part, but I''ll leave that comment in for your entertainment :P</td>', 'The textures are great, the smoke is just right, and the lighting works well.  The only thing that didn''t strike me right on my first impression is that the feet seem too close to the door.  It feels to me like the toes must be almost under it which takes away from the feeling (that I imagine you intended) that this ominous door is about to be opened.  Still, the overall effect works well and it''s very otherworldly indeed. ---After looking at it for a while, it strikes me that my initial bias was to see the door as pulling open rather than pushing open.  Strange psychology on my part, but I''ll leave that comment in for your entertainment :P', '2008-04-16 21:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4644750, 667840, 83080, '<td valign="top">Great creative use of Woody!  The light off of the mirror seems slightly overdone to me as it obscures the woody reflection a bit much IMHO.  Overall, it''s very effective and wonderfully imaginative.</td>', 'Great creative use of Woody!  The light off of the mirror seems slightly overdone to me as it obscures the woody reflection a bit much IMHO.  Overall, it''s very effective and wonderfully imaginative.', '2008-04-16 21:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
