(4645569, 669884, 89431, '<td valign="top">I don''t think that religon is that paranormal really, weird maybe but I think you just missed the mark a bit. The lighting and compostition looks really good though, and it is a nice photograph overall.</td>', 'I don''t think that religon is that paranormal really, weird maybe but I think you just missed the mark a bit. The lighting and compostition looks really good though, and it is a nice photograph overall.', '2008-04-17 10:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645573, 669350, 89431, '<td valign="top">I like the graininess and the desaturation of the whole thing. It reminds me of White Noise, (that one mediocre horror movie). The high contrast draws a lot of attention and I think you really hit the mark with this one, well done.</td>', 'I like the graininess and the desaturation of the whole thing. It reminds me of White Noise, (that one mediocre horror movie). The high contrast draws a lot of attention and I think you really hit the mark with this one, well done.', '2008-04-17 10:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645583, 669419, 89431, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure what your going for here, the background is kinda dull with the highway &amp; all the blue negative space in the sky, there is really nothing paranormal about it. The cord is way too bright and the giant reflection doesn''t say ghost or alien to me since it is so disproportioned to the rest of the photograph. But the lighting and the reflection in the water looks really nice and I would def. shoot there again during a more appropriate challenge b/c the location</td>', 'I''m not really sure what your going for here, the background is kinda dull with the highway & all the blue negative space in the sky, there is really nothing paranormal about it. The cord is way too bright and the giant reflection doesn''t say ghost or alien to me since it is so disproportioned to the rest of the photograph. But the lighting and the reflection in the water looks really nice and I would def. shoot there again during a more appropriate challenge b/c the location', '2008-04-17 11:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645590, 669840, 89431, '<td valign="top">Aw it looks like it was made with a cookie cutter... The little legs look disproportioned and it lokks like certain spots in the forest blurred for no reason. But I like this because it''s weird and thats what paranormal is about.The ghostly figure is so white though, it makes the forest look really dull, you probably need to add some contrast there.</td>', 'Aw it looks like it was made with a cookie cutter... The little legs look disproportioned and it lokks like certain spots in the forest blurred for no reason. But I like this because it''s weird and thats what paranormal is about.The ghostly figure is so white though, it makes the forest look really dull, you probably need to add some contrast there.', '2008-04-17 11:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645595, 668757, 89431, '<td valign="top">I like how this tells a story and the stark white walls and railing match the ghostliness of, well, the ghost. Maybe a bit to sterile looking but i like it. The lighting on the boy and dow the hallway looks really nice and intense.</td>', 'I like how this tells a story and the stark white walls and railing match the ghostliness of, well, the ghost. Maybe a bit to sterile looking but i like it. The lighting on the boy and dow the hallway looks really nice and intense.', '2008-04-17 11:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645601, 669652, 89431, '<td valign="top">I bet you wish you could do spot editing on the tape that shows on the neck of the bottle. :D I really like this photograph though, the cropping and lighting look excellent. and i really like the color of the bottle, and how it is highlighted by the white of everything else. Good concept.</td>', 'I bet you wish you could do spot editing on the tape that shows on the neck of the bottle. :D I really like this photograph though, the cropping and lighting look excellent. and i really like the color of the bottle, and how it is highlighted by the white of everything else. Good concept.', '2008-04-17 11:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645619, 669974, 89431, '<td valign="top">Oh my, a witch hanging I''m guessing. Interseting take on the challenge, this reminds me a bit of Melanie Pullen''s work. The tilting brings this photo to up a level. it does however, look really edited around the edges and on the ground...</td>', 'Oh my, a witch hanging I''m guessing. Interseting take on the challenge, this reminds me a bit of Melanie Pullen''s work. The tilting brings this photo to up a level. it does however, look really edited around the edges and on the ground...', '2008-04-17 11:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645624, 669652, 68947, '<td valign="top">Yeah, but can you get your spouse or kids to pick up their dity socks?! *grin*  Great shot!</td>', 'Yeah, but can you get your spouse or kids to pick up their dity socks?! *grin*  Great shot!', '2008-04-17 11:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645625, 669345, 89431, '<td valign="top">Aw, what a cute couple. I like how you added the paranormal into this in two ways, one with the dead guy riding around and two with the "psychic power of premonition". Well done.</td>', 'Aw, what a cute couple. I like how you added the paranormal into this in two ways, one with the dead guy riding around and two with the "psychic power of premonition". Well done.', '2008-04-17 11:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645632, 668109, 89431, '<td valign="top">Finally something new to the whole "pretty sunset picture". The colors look beautiful, especially reflected on the water. But, the line in the water is a little distracting and confusing. I really like the concept and execution.</td>', 'Finally something new to the whole "pretty sunset picture". The colors look beautiful, especially reflected on the water. But, the line in the water is a little distracting and confusing. I really like the concept and execution.', '2008-04-17 11:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645638, 669240, 89431, '<td valign="top">Nice play on words! The photograph itself looks really nice with only all the primary colors there in some form. (i consider that table to be blue)</td>', 'Nice play on words! The photograph itself looks really nice with only all the primary colors there in some form. (i consider that table to be blue)', '2008-04-17 11:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645727, 669786, 45790, '<td valign="top">Good for laugh and actually not a bad shot! Probably better if labeled "Real UFO" rather than "FAKE UFO" for increased laugh potential.</td>', 'Good for laugh and actually not a bad shot! Probably better if labeled "Real UFO" rather than "FAKE UFO" for increased laugh potential.', '2008-04-17 12:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645730, 669593, 45790, '<td valign="top">I assume this was a jump? It would be better if the head wasn''t cut off. This way it looks like she might be held up (and painfully) by the head.</td>', 'I assume this was a jump? It would be better if the head wasn''t cut off. This way it looks like she might be held up (and painfully) by the head.', '2008-04-17 12:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645734, 669922, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish the light were a bit more dramatic.</td>', 'I wish the light were a bit more dramatic.', '2008-04-17 12:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645736, 669830, 45790, '<td valign="top">Clever! Never before has blocking the lens been used as a major positive.</td>', 'Clever! Never before has blocking the lens been used as a major positive.', '2008-04-17 12:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645738, 668378, 45790, '<td valign="top">The most believable "ghost" I''ve seen so far in this challenge.</td>', 'The most believable "ghost" I''ve seen so far in this challenge.', '2008-04-17 12:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645740, 669593, 47470, '<td valign="top">Too bad we can''t see her face and her surprise at being able to levitate.</td>', 'Too bad we can''t see her face and her surprise at being able to levitate.', '2008-04-17 12:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645743, 670058, 17513, '<td valign="top">best picture i have seen so far,well done</td>', 'best picture i have seen so far,well done', '2008-04-17 12:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645745, 669137, 45790, '<td valign="top">Sharp picture but lighting could be improved to eliminate the glare</td>', 'Sharp picture but lighting could be improved to eliminate the glare', '2008-04-17 12:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645746, 669253, 47470, '<td valign="top">Nice technique to get the hazy halo around the figure, but the busy background is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nice technique to get the hazy halo around the figure, but the busy background is a bit distracting.', '2008-04-17 12:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645749, 668679, 17513, '<td valign="top">love the green and red contrast,good picture well done</td>', 'love the green and red contrast,good picture well done', '2008-04-17 12:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645754, 670057, 47470, '<td valign="top">He looks too clean and solid for a typical ghost!</td>', 'He looks too clean and solid for a typical ghost!', '2008-04-17 12:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645762, 669652, 17513, '<td valign="top">fabulas picture,infact its one of the best so far.well done</td>', 'fabulas picture,infact its one of the best so far.well done', '2008-04-17 12:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645763, 669560, 47470, '<td valign="top">She should be closer to the grave so you could crop closer on everything.  I also wish he were a bit more fleeting/see-through.  Still a nice photo.</td>', 'She should be closer to the grave so you could crop closer on everything.  I also wish he were a bit more fleeting/see-through.  Still a nice photo.', '2008-04-17 12:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645767, 669652, 47470, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice, but I can see the tape.  Too bad you couldn''t edit it out!</td>', 'Pretty nice, but I can see the tape.  Too bad you couldn''t edit it out!', '2008-04-17 12:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4645768, 667840, 47470, '<td valign="top">Took me a second to see Woody.  Kinda busy.</td>', 'Took me a second to see Woody.  Kinda busy.', '2008-04-17 12:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
