(4646160, 669532, 91496, '<td valign="top">Not enough paranormal for me.  The objects are all very everyday.  The composition is great and when they have a Green Day challenge I''ll give you an 8 or 9.</td>', 'Not enough paranormal for me.  The objects are all very everyday.  The composition is great and when they have a Green Day challenge I''ll give you an 8 or 9.', '2008-04-17 17:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
