(4646174, 669541, 91496, '<td valign="top">The moon as a subject is kind of normal rather than paranormal, as it is an everyday object.  The Man in the Moon would be paranormal if you could find/fake a picture of him.  That said, it is a nice photo.  Maybe placing the moon off-center would have more impact.</td>', 'The moon as a subject is kind of normal rather than paranormal, as it is an everyday object.  The Man in the Moon would be paranormal if you could find/fake a picture of him.  That said, it is a nice photo.  Maybe placing the moon off-center would have more impact.', '2008-04-17 18:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4646264, 669830, 47470, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but it kinda looks like this was taken on a PnS when the lens cover didn''t fully open.</td>', 'I like the idea, but it kinda looks like this was taken on a PnS when the lens cover didn''t fully open.', '2008-04-17 18:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
