(4649210, 670057, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and fairly well executed, but somewhat anachronistic. He''s dressed like Benny Goodman, but he''s playing a modern digital instrument. Of course, if he''s coming back from the past, he might be amusing himself with this modern marvel. Still, it would have been more interesting if it were a real piano. In any case, I''m not sure we need to see the back of the instrument -- a different angle or a more overhead view (with a better view of the keys) would have worked better.</td>', 'Nice idea and fairly well executed, but somewhat anachronistic. He''s dressed like Benny Goodman, but he''s playing a modern digital instrument. Of course, if he''s coming back from the past, he might be amusing himself with this modern marvel. Still, it would have been more interesting if it were a real piano. In any case, I''m not sure we need to see the back of the instrument -- a different angle or a more overhead view (with a better view of the keys) would have worked better.', '2008-04-19 21:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4649211, 669633, 72252, '<td valign="top">Go into the light... well done 7</td>', 'Go into the light... well done 7', '2008-04-19 21:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
