(4659617, 670003, 45524, '<td valign="top">I really liked this shot, too bad its going to get DQed for cloning in basic. Better luck next time. <br/> <br/>1- Open Raw. <br/>2- White Balance to Shade in CS3. <br/>3- Contrast. <br/>4- Saturation. <br/>5- Coloned couple of sparks. &lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;not allowed in basic.<br/>6- Neat Image. <br/>7- Crop. <br/>8- USM. <br/>9- Save for the web. <br/> <br/></td>', 'I really liked this shot, too bad its going to get DQed for cloning in basic. Better luck next time.  1- Open Raw. 2- White Balance to Shade in CS3. 3- Contrast. 4- Saturation. 5- Coloned couple of sparks. <<<<<not allowed in basic.6- Neat Image. 7- Crop. 8- USM. 9- Save for the web.  ', '2008-04-25 19:41:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4659664, 670003, 28322, '<td valign="top">[quote=MattO] I really liked this shot, too bad its going to get DQed for cloning in basic. Better luck next time. <br/> <br/>5- Coloned couple of sparks. &lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;not allowed in basic.<br/> <br/>Hi Matto, please check the '''' You may not '''' section in the rules page .. it says: spot-edit your entry, except to remove sensor dust or hot pixels.<br/> <br/>and this is what I did exactly, removing few hot pixels .. it is a minor imperfiction, <br/>All the best. <br/></td>', '[quote=MattO] I really liked this shot, too bad its going to get DQed for cloning in basic. Better luck next time.  5- Coloned couple of sparks. <<<<<not allowed in basic. Hi Matto, please check the '''' You may not '''' section in the rules page .. it says: spot-edit your entry, except to remove sensor dust or hot pixels. and this is what I did exactly, removing few hot pixels .. it is a minor imperfiction, All the best. ', '2008-04-25 20:50:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4659665, 670003, 28322, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Kliopatra:</b></div><hr/><i> Great Shot,It looks so real. Please submit the setup photo. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hi Kliopatra, sorry, I didn''t think this picture will do that good in the challenge, I didn''t take any setup pictures, next time will do for sure .. <br/>All the best,</td>', 'Originally posted by Kliopatra: Great Shot,It looks so real. Please submit the setup photo.   Hi Kliopatra, sorry, I didn''t think this picture will do that good in the challenge, I didn''t take any setup pictures, next time will do for sure .. All the best,', '2008-04-25 20:50:53.000000', NULL, 0),
